# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit .env.local.

# Public site origin, used for canonical URLs, the sitemap and absolute OG
# image URLs.
#
# Either set a real value or leave it unset — do NOT define it with an empty
# value. An empty variable used to crash the build with a bare "Invalid URL"
# during page-data collection; lib/site.ts now treats empty, whitespace-only
# and malformed values as absent and falls back, so this is no longer fatal,
# but an empty value still means the fallback origin is what ships.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://www.bundleofrays.com

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Enquiry delivery (choose ONE)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option A — Resend (recommended).
#
# VERIFY A SUBDOMAIN, NOT THE ROOT DOMAIN. This matters more than it looks.
#
# Verifying bundleofrays.com itself means adding an SPF record at the root —
# where one already exists for the business's real mail. A domain may have
# exactly ONE SPF record: a second does not add to it, it produces a
# permerror, and SPF then fails for ALL mail from the domain, including mail
# to Queensland Health. It is among the most common self-inflicted mail
# outages there is, and nothing warns you.
#
# Verify send.bundleofrays.com instead. Resend's SPF, DKIM and DMARC records
# go under the subdomain, where there is nothing to collide with, and the
# website's sending reputation stays isolated from the founder's inbox — so
# abuse of the enquiry form cannot damage real correspondence. MX records are
# untouched either way.
#
# FROM must be on the verified subdomain; TO can be any inbox. Reply-To is
# set to the enquirer in app/contact/actions.ts, so replies behave normally.
#
# Note on residency: Resend processes in the US, and /privacy says so. If an
# institutional buyer requires in-region processing, swap for SES in
# ap-southeast-2 or Postmark EU — only deliver() in app/contact/actions.ts
# changes, and /privacy changes in the same release.
#
# Full sequence: docs/09-go-live.md
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# ENQUIRY_TO_EMAIL=brad@bundleofrays.com
# ENQUIRY_FROM_EMAIL=website@send.bundleofrays.com

# Option B — post the enquiry anywhere (Zapier, a CRM, an internal endpoint).
# ENQUIRY_WEBHOOK_URL=

# With neither set, enquiries are logged WITHOUT PII and not delivered.
# Safe for local development; must be configured before launch.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Analytics (optional)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If unset, PostHog never initialises and the site behaves identically.
# There is deliberately no default key, so a fork cannot silently send data.
# Use the EU host if data residency matters to institutional customers.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST=https://eu.i.posthog.com
